WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.248
"A kitten is going to stay with us," Mom said.

2
00:00:09.249 --> 00:00:12.977
"Her name is Nugget."

3
00:00:12.978 --> 00:00:15.338
"Cool," Harry said.

4
00:00:15.339 --> 00:00:21.511
Emmy smiled. "I love kittens!"

5
00:00:21.512 --> 00:00:25.517
Rover barked. Woof!

6
00:00:25.518 --> 00:00:30.231
"I wonder if Rover likes kittens," Oliver said.

7
00:00:30.232 --> 00:00:34.364
"Nugget will just stay for the weekend," Mom said.

8
00:00:34.365 --> 00:00:37.798
"She belongs to Mrs. Rue."

9
00:00:37.799 --> 00:00:41.491
The next day Mrs. Rue came over.

10
00:00:41.492 --> 00:00:45.533
"This is Nugget," she said.

11
00:00:45.534 --> 00:00:48.821
"Thanks for watching her."

12
00:00:48.822 --> 00:00:53.276
Mrs. Rue left.

13
00:00:53.277 --> 00:00:56.752
Nugget looked up at everyone.

14
00:00:56.753 --> 00:01:00.346
She was fuzzy with big paws.

15
00:01:00.347 --> 00:01:05.402
"Aww! She's tiny," Emmy said.

16
00:01:05.403 --> 00:01:10.081
Meow! Nugget rolled over.

17
00:01:10.082 --> 00:01:14.678
She swatted Oliver's foot.

18
00:01:14.679 --> 00:01:19.108
Nugget climbed up the side of the sofa.

19
00:01:19.109 --> 00:01:23.493
Woof! Rover ran over.

20
00:01:23.494 --> 00:01:27.294
Nugget jumped and ran fast.

21
00:01:27.295 --> 00:01:30.164
Rover chased Nugget.

22
00:01:30.165 --> 00:01:33.144
"Oh no!" Emmy said.

23
00:01:33.145 --> 00:01:36.323
"Rover might hurt Nugget!"

24
00:01:36.324 --> 00:01:38.770
Mom bit her lip.

25
00:01:38.771 --> 00:01:41.937
Nugget hid under a chair.

26
00:01:41.938 --> 00:01:46.136
"Let's leave her alone," Aunt Judy said.

27
00:01:46.137 --> 00:01:50.882
"She'll come out when she's ready."

28
00:01:50.883 --> 00:01:53.556
Later Rover was sleeping.

29
00:01:53.557 --> 00:01:56.883
Nugget peeked out from under the chair.

30
00:01:56.884 --> 00:02:01.421
She crept toward Rover.

31
00:02:01.422 --> 00:02:04.672
"Uh-oh," Emmy said.

32
00:02:04.673 --> 00:02:08.242
"I hope Rover doesn't hurt Nugget."

33
00:02:08.243 --> 00:02:13.596
Suddenly Nugget pounced on Rover.

34
00:02:13.597 --> 00:02:16.432
Rover tried to get up.

35
00:02:16.433 --> 00:02:19.709
Nugget pounced again!

36
00:02:19.710 --> 00:02:22.489
Emmy gasped.

37
00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:28.907
"Yikes! I hope Nugget doesn't hurt Rover!"

38
00:02:28.908 --> 00:02:31.833
Rover wagged his tail.

39
00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:35.608
He gave Nugget a big, wet kiss.

40
00:02:35.609 --> 00:02:41.641
Everyone laughed.

41
00:02:41.642 --> 00:02:49.209
Emmy smiled. "I guess they're friends now!"

